{
  "title": "Urea\u2013creatinine coupling adds little cross-sample DSST prediction beyond component and ratio effects",
  "abstract": "In 1,290 NHANES 2011\u20132012 and 1,505 separately sampled 2013\u20132014 adults aged 60+, a centered log-BUN \u00d7 log-creatinine term reduced validation DSST MSE by 0.088970 score\u00b2 (0.054%) beyond flexible component and ratio effects. The source-refit/target-PSU 95% interval for augmented-minus-baseline MSE was [-1.981956, 3.296878]. Reliable incremental prediction is not established.",
